{"product":{"id":10155715592466,"title":"Barrel Hinge","body_html":"\u003cp\u003eThese inline barrel hinges are incredibly useful for creating doors and adding motion to EMT Conduit builds. They are four inches tall and have an outside diameter of .94 inches. To use it, simply clamp 3\/4\" Maker Pipe Connectors around the top and bottom half as if they were pieces of conduit (see picture three or the video below). These hinges are coated with the same durable and corrosion resistant silver zinc coating that we use for all of our connectors. One hinge includes the male and female barrels and a small bearing.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e*Includes 1 complete hinge. \u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e*B-Stock is fully functional but has varying cosmetic defects.\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/em\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c!-- split --\u003e\n\u003ch1 style=\"text-align: center;\"\u003eBarrel Hinge Overview\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/h1\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"wrapper\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"youtube\" data-embed=\"Lte7HoIdgAE\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"play-button\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"row cc-two-columns\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"eight columns alpha\"\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003ch3 style=\"text-align: center;\"\u003eSee It In Action\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cdiv style=\"text-align: center;\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"wrapper\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"youtube\" data-embed=\"3j3I2IrQOGM\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"play-button\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"eight columns omega\"\u003e\n\u003ch3 style=\"text-align: center;\"\u003eOther Hinges\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cdiv style=\"text-align: center;\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"wrapper\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"youtube\" d